@startuml
title Gold Miner Deployment Diagram

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

node "Client Machine" as Client {
  component "client.py\nHuman Player Client" as C
}

node "Server Machine" as Server {
  component "server.py\nSequencer Server" as S
  component "game.py\nGame Logic" as G
  component "Bot AI\nServer Controlled" as B
}

C --> S : sends moves\nZMQ PUSH
S --> C : broadcasts game state\nZMQ PUB

S --> G : applies moves\nupdates scores
S --> B : controls bots
B --> G : bot movement

note bottom of Server
The server stores the authoritative game state.
Clients only send input and render updates.
end note

@enduml